# Per-board maintainers for msm8916-openwrt
# ----------------------------------------
# The `main` branch is protected. All changes land via Pull Request + review.
# Maintainers get Write access so they can push branches and self-merge their
# own board PRs after review, but they cannot push directly to `main`.
#
# The lead (@akbar-npj) owns the shared build pipeline, the device table
# (msm89xx/image/msm8916.mk), and every board-independent patch.
# Board-specific device-tree patches and diffconfigs are owned by the hardware
# owners listed below. A board may list more than one; GitHub accepts an
# approval from any of them.

# --- UZ801 (maintained by @isprogrammer and @giraygokirmak) ---
msm89xx/patches/803-arm64-dts-qcom-uz801-leds-and-button.patch  @isprogrammer @giraygokirmak @akbar-npj
msm89xx/patches/851-arm64-dts-qcom-uf02-uz801-a2-pin.patch      @isprogrammer @giraygokirmak @akbar-npj
msm89xx/image/msm8916.mk                                        @akbar-npj

# --- UFI003 (maintained by @isprogrammer) ---
msm89xx/patches/852-arm64-dts-qcom-add-msm8916-generic-ufi003.patch  @isprogrammer @akbar-npj
diffconfigs/ufi003                                               @isprogrammer @akbar-npj

# --- UZ801 config + everything else defaults to the lead ---
diffconfigs/uz801  @isprogrammer @giraygokirmak @akbar-npj
*  @akbar-npj
